<title>USA: Loral wins satellite contract.</title>
<headline>Loral wins satellite contract.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loral Space &amp; Communications Ltd's Space Systems/Loral unit said it entered a contract with the International Telecommunications Satellite Organization (INTELSAT) to build two high-powered satellites.</p>
<p>Under the contract, which with options for additional satellites has a program value exceeding $600 million, it will will build and deliver two satellites for launch in the summer and late fall of the year 2000, it said.</p>
</text>
